QuestGuidance.Register("en",270,{
[8609]="7005955F\n1\tComplete Mission: A Looming Collapse\tYour mission is to stop the Tarkrîp Orcs before they collapse the mines of Writhenset. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8610]="7005956A\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at the beginning of the tunnel to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDestroy bombs (total: 10)\030Destroy powder crates (total: 10)\tYou should destroy bombs and powder crates. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tReturn to the mine entrance\tYou should return to the mine entrance. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8611]="7005BF6C\n1\tInvestigate lost tools (total: 10)\tInvestigate dwarf-made tools left in the snow.\n2\tRecover lost journal (quantity: see journal)\tFind written evidence of the previous dwarves.\n",
[8612]="7005BF6D\n1\tComplete Mission: A Lost Expedition\tYour mission is to find evidence of the dwarf expedition in the snow-fields. Speak to Ausma to travel to the snow-fields.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8613]="7006C540\n1\tComplete Mission: A Moment of Hope\tYour mission is to travel to Maurûsh and attack the Orcs before they can regain their strength. Speak to Ashâmi to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ashâmi\tYou have successfully weakened the Orcs in Maurûsh. Return with the scout to Ashâmi with this report.\n",
[8614]="7006907A\n1\tComplete Mission: A Natural Disaster\tYour mission is to address the huorn problem on the Cape by paring their number back. Speak to Deshra to travel.\n2\tTalk to Deshra\tYou have successfully defeated the huorn threat! Return to the mission giver with this report.\n",
[8615]="7005894E\n1\tDestroy cold-drake eggs at Kêr Bréin (total: 10)\tYour mission is to destroy cold-drake eggs at Kêr Bréin.\n",
[8616]="70058968\n1\tComplete 'Mission: A New Clutch'\tYour mission is to destroy cold-drake eggs at Kêr Bréin. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Kêr Bréin.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8617]="7006EC04\n1\tComplete Mission: A Personal Plea\tYour mission is to reach the Ekhamâti camp where they are holding prisoners and free any that you can. Then put an end to the executioner before he can harm any more people. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to reach the Ekhamâti camp where they are holding prisoners and free any that you can. Then put an end to the executioner before he can harm any more people.\n",
[8618]="70062BEE\n1\tDestroy unsecured food barrels (total: 12)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8619]="70062BF5\n1\tComplete Mission: A Plague of Men\tSpeak with the mission giver and make your way to the ruins of Gaervarad to destroy the spoiling supplies held there by the brigands.\n2\tReturn to the mission giver and tell them of your success\tAfter entering the ruins, dispatching a number of enemies, and destroying a good number of the rotting barrels of food, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your success.\n",
[8620]="7006E4D5\n1\tComplete Mission: A Rare Vintage\tThere are goblins throughout Limael's Vineyard and they have stolen a rare wine. You have been asked to recover the bottles that the goblins have not yet drunk or destroyed. There are also still some late-season grapes on the vines. Collecting enough of them would allow Brethilwen to vinify one more cask of wine.\n2\tTalk to the Hooded Stranger in The Prancing Pony\tYou have recovered as much of the rare wine as you were able and even collected enough grapes for Brethilwen to make one more cask of wine this season.\n",
[8621]="7006EBC5\n1\tComplete Mission: A Surfeit of Weapons\tYour mission is to steal weapons from within a nearby Ekhamâti camp and defeat as many soldiers as you can. You must make it out before reinforcements arrive. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to steal weapons from within a nearby Ekhamâti camp and defeat as many soldiers as you can. You must make it out before reinforcements arrive.\n",
[8622]="70058421\n1\tComplete 'Mission: A Taste For Battle'\tYour mission is to destroy the cache of Orkish provisions stored in Bekâr-zarakh. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Bekâr-zarakh.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8623]="700583EC\n1\tDestroy Orkish provisions in Bekâr-zarakh (total: 10)\tYour mission is to destroy the cache of Orkish provisions stored in Bekâr-zarakh.\n2\tDefeat Goglugúth\tAfter destroying the cache of Orkish provisions stored in Bekâr-zarakh, a furious Orc has blocked your escape and challenged you. You must defeat Goglugúth.\n",
[8624]="7006907D\n1\tComplete Mission: A Taste for Crab\tYour mission is to aid in harvesting crabs in Zamarzîr and to fight off any crabs or beasts that get in your way. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tTalk to Malthak\tYou have successfully harvested the crabs and defeated the greater cast-mother! Return with the Umbari scout to the mission giver with this report.\n",
[8625]="70071DF6\n1\tComplete Mission: A Treasure in Blue\tYour mission is to travel to the Halls of Lajór in Zajâna and retrieve a stolen book of great historical significance, \"The Farings of Kábuzar.\" Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have retrieved the book, \"The Farings of Kábuzar.\" Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8626]="700585A7\n1\tRecover supplies (total: 12)\tRecover supplies.\n",
[8627]="700585B5\n1\tComplete Mission: Abandoned Supplies\tYour mission is to collect the abandoned supplies scattered throughout Stramvárth. Speak to Hórin to travel to Stramvárth.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8628]="70062FC0\n1\tDiscover the walking trees and eliminate them (total: 15)\t\n2\tFind and speak with a Scout\t\n",
[8629]="70063032\n1\tComplete the Mission: Aberrations of Nature\tSomething is lurking in the woods in the Stoor-vales and hobbit scouts want someone to look into what it is. Speak with the mission giver at Clegur to assist.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tThere were wood trolls lurking in the woods and ruins. This is not a good development and you should let the mission giver know.\n",
[8630]="70057F0B\n1\tTake your post upon the bridge\tTake your post upon the bridge.\n2\tKeep your post and defend the bridge builders\tKeep your post and defend the bridge builders of the Hadhodiant. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[8631]="70057F58\n1\tComplete Mission: Aiding the Bridge Builders\tYour mission is to defend the bridge builders of the Hadhodiant. Speak to Ausma to travel to the Hadhodiant.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8632]="7005AA33\n1\tComplete missions for the Kharum-ubnâr (total: 10)\tVorthur Smokebreath can be found at Akrâz-zahar, in Erebor. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and complete missions for the Kharum-ubnâr.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tVorthur Smokebreath can be found at Akrâz-zahar, in Erebor. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath.\n",
[8633]="7006C53C\n1\tComplete Mission: All Out Battle\tYour mission is to travel to Sar-kidul and take the fight to the Orcs. Speak to Ashâmi to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ashâmi\tYou have successfully eliminated Orcs in Sar-kidul. Return with the scout to Ashâmi with this report.\n",
[8634]="70062FC2\n1\tPlace black powder under watch-towers (total: 8)\t\n2\tFind and speak with the scout\t\n",
[8635]="7006302B\n1\tComplete the Mission: Among the Watch-towers\tRemoving the enemy's ability to see over long distances will give an advantage to attackers making their way against the forces of brigands. You should visit the mission giver in Lhan Garan to begin your assault.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tAfter some effort you were able to neutralize the watch-towers and some of the enemy stationed at the encampment. Return to Lhan Garan and tell the mission giver of your success.\n",
[8636]="700583EA\n1\tCollect dwarf-made weapons at Bekâr-zarakh (total: 14)\tYour mission is to reclaim dwarf-made weapons held as trophies by the Orcs in Bekâr-zarakh.\n",
[8637]="70058424\n1\tComplete 'Mission: An Agelong Theft'\tYour mission is to reclaim dwarf-made weapons held as trophies by the Orcs in Bekâr-zarakh. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Bekâr-zarakh.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8638]="700585A3\n1\tDefeat the Frost-horde assault\tDefeat the Frost-horde assault.\n",
[8639]="700585B8\n1\tComplete Mission: An Assault of Frost\tYour mission is to defend the fortress of Skarháld from a Frost-horde assault. Speak to Hórin to travel to Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8640]="7006C12A\n1\tComplete Mission: An Explosive Assault\tYour mission is to sabotage the Ordâkhai siege engines under construction at Ghât Lor and defeat any Ordâkhai who move to stop you. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have destroyed all the siege engines! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
})
